    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshua ogosemia Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’engaki entambe, ekero Omonene konya aeire Abaisraeli obotoereru korwa ase ababisa babo abwo baabaetanaine, na Yoshua konya ogotire mono,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akarangeria Abaisraeli bonsi: abagaaka, na abatang’ani, na abagaambi, amo nabaraai babo, akabateebia, “Inche nabeire omogaka omogotu mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe mweroreire aya onsi Omonene, Nyasae oino, akorire ase abanto aba bonsi b’ebisaku ebi ase engencho yaino. Omonene, Nyasae oino, nere obeire okobarwanera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora, ase ogoaka obomera naatananeire ebisaku biaino ense y’abanto aba batigarete amo ney’abwo konya nasiririe, ebe omwando oino, ense yonsi korwa orooche rwa Yorodani goika Enyancha Enene ya bosongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene, Nyasae oino, nere oraserie abanto abwo baabatame, nainwe moire ense yabo moyemenye, buna Omonene, Nyasae oino, abarierete eira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo, motenene bokong’u, morende na koigwera boronge aya onsi ariikire ase Egetabu ki’Amachiko a Musa, timoonchoka gochia aande onsi, ensemo y’okorio gose ey’okobee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa gosanga nabaanto aba b’ebisaku batigarete ase egati yaino, gose timwatora amarieta e chinyasae chiabo, gose gotiana ase chirochio. Timochikorera gose gochisasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe mobe abegenwa ase Omonene, buna mwabeire goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene oseririe abanto b’ebisaku ebinene bire ne chinguru; onde tari obabuire goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyomo oino nanyare goseria abanto elifu eyemo, ekiagera Omonene, Nyasae oino, nere okobarwanera esegi, buna abarierete eira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, mwerende, momwanche Omonene, Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moise koonchoka korwa asare, na mobwatane nabaanto aba batigarete ase egati yaino, na konyuomerana, na igo mobe mogosanga nabarabwo, nabarabwo nainwe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rirorio goika momanye ng’a Omonene, Nyasae oino, tagoseria abanto aba korwa ase more, korende barabwo nigo barabe bakobatega, naende babe buna ebiranya bikobang’wania amakere aino, na buna amagwa akobeta amaiso aino. Goika mosirigwe kegima korwa ase ense eye engiy’Omonene, Nyasae oino, abaeire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bono nkogenda inde enchera eria abanto bonsi b’ense bagochia. Mwamanyire buya ase chinkoro chiaino ime, na ase emioyo yaino boigo, ng’a timoremeiri gento kende gionsi ekiya eke Omonene, Nyasae oino, abarierete eira ng’a nakebae. Amang’ana ayio onsi aikeranire, rinde tiriremeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bun’Omonene, Nyasae oino aikeranetie amaya onsi aya abarierete eira ng’a nakore, naboigo araikeranie amabe onsi goika abasirie korwa ase ense eye engiya abaeire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye mogosaria okobwatana kw’Omonene, Nyasae oino, okwo abachigete, naende mogokorera chinyasae chinde na gochisasiima, erio endamwamu yaye inayoke igoro yaino, nainwe bwango mosire korwa ase ense eye engiya abaeire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
